%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogos_en-GB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-GB
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca04b4563edbfa94da0e38426ad7282a, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1885939011584
    m_Localized: "Before you venture any further, allow me to\noffer some advice.
      \nThis train has its quirks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2023369576448
    m_Localized: "To interact with passengers or objects, press \u201CE\u201D. \nIf
      you\u2019d like to keep your wings free, just press \u201CF\u201D to drop what
      you\u2019re carrying.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2027467411456
    m_Localized: "You also possess a notepad to keep track of clues. \nPress \u201CE\u201D
      to write them down and \u201CQ\u201D to review them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2029568757760
    m_Localized: "If you press \u201C1\u201D you will uncover some of the train\u2019s
      fading memories."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2701978603520
    m_Localized: "Lastly, if you fancy a change of perspective, \nwalk up to a bar
      above the seats and press \u201C2\u201D \nto hang from it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2726376869888
    m_Localized: "If you have any further questions, feel free to speak to me again,
      or press \u201CP\u201D to review the controls in the pause menu. \nGood luck,
      Detective."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7272570392576
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m all ears."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7301112631296
    m_Localized: "Sadly, being a sociopathic detective \ndoes involve talking to
      people."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7316916768768
    m_Localized: "Having me think this hard at a time \nlike this is nothing short
      of torture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7331366146048
    m_Localized: I once solved a case with nothing but a sardine tin. No sardines,
      mind you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7339893166080
    m_Localized: "Those bars better be secure, or someone\u2019s \ngetting sued."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7350345371648
    m_Localized: Thank you miss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10216074219520
    m_Localized: Owl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25027751284736
    m_Localized: Fox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25095069863936
    m_Localized: "Papers everywhere, yet not a single scribble! Either there\u2019s
      been a pen strike, I\u2019m not seeing the whole picture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25264461025280
    m_Localized: A pen strike. How convenient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87760253325312
    m_Localized: Mouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87813718118400
    m_Localized: "What possessed me to cook with butter?! My paws are so greasy that
      I can\u2019t even open the bloody cupboard to get more ingredients!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88497423224832
    m_Localized: "The code? I was in such a rush that I forgot about it. \nAlthough
      I\u2019m sure I wrote it down while I was preparing the menu. Let me know when
      you get that cupboard open though."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91254330855424
    m_Localized: "The cupboard\u2019s open? Perhaps all is not lost for this kitchen
      just yet! Press the \u20183\u2019 key while looking at a tray, that should
      help you hear what you\u2019re looking for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104603466698752
    m_Localized: "One customer kept repeating every single thing I said while placing
      his order: \u201CStrawberries? Oranges?\u201D Obviously! What else could possibly
      go in a fruit salad?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104893616066560
    m_Localized: "Another customer wouldn\u2019t stop drooling when I mentioned the
      roasted pork! I can hardly blame him, after all, I\u2019m a culinary genius!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104990814867456
    m_Localized: This customer had barely glanced at the menu before informing me
      he was a pescatarian. I simply pointed out that fish is meat, and the bloke
      nearly clawed my eyes out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105221795188736
    m_Localized: "I recommended the potato soup to another customer, and he asked
      me, completely straight-faced: \u201CDoes it come with flies?\u201D I thought
      he was setting up a joke, but he was dead serious\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105294079823872
    m_Localized: Come find me afterwards so I can make sure you've got it right.
      If you haven't, I'll beat you to a pulp! (And if you have, I'll do it anyway.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105389881921536
    m_Localized: "No, no, no, the trays are all wrong! \nGet your ears working! I
      don't want to deal with \na herd of angry customers!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105462053310464
    m_Localized: Well, I'll be damned! You managed to actually be useful! Go on then,
      off to your precious driver you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 105583260307456
    m_Localized: Are you lost or what? Get outta here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 107966644195328
    m_Localized: "Wash your paws\u2026 or tell me the code."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108146118463488
    m_Localized: Your handwriting better be legible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108487237013504
    m_Localized: "And how am I supposed to know \nwho's getting which dish?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 108791613460480
    m_Localized: Back home, we garnish ours with mosquitoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109136586575872
    m_Localized: I could grab a bite...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109437511110656
    m_Localized: Got lucky this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109635352236032
    m_Localized: Probably a gym bro trying to hit his protein goal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 109945583931392
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110222554796032
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll take that as a polite request."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110544442462208
    m_Localized: So awfully kind of you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 110869496827904
    m_Localized: "I only came to say my goodbyes\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133963280125952
    m_Localized: Raccoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134132126027776
    m_Localized: "The mechanism only\u2026 only gives us one shot! ONE! If even one
      part is wrong, it\u2019s over, over \nfor all of us!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134539820765184
    m_Localized: "Since when did the wall have\u2026 such strange details? I'm going
      insane\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134725301276672
    m_Localized: Anything else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134837314359296
    m_Localized: "At this rate, that\u2019ll be two of us\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
